18ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":"jsr54leknocd97tb0zzqoj7rm","title":"ChatGPT 新增动画 GIF 生成功能","summary":"OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 和 API 中推出图像生成升级，周均生成量超40亿张（较9月增长）。新增GIF制作功能，支持调整动画速度、编辑单帧及分享，并推出GPT-Image-2.6 Flare和Sunburst API以提升生成速度和质量。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1026474/openai-chatgpt-animated-gifs-images-2-6","publishedAt":"2026-11-04T18:00:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"rbopao61zwqs4sccqyz4ip1jq","title":"AWS无服务器MCP服务器架构：AI智能体数据湖访问解决方案","summary":"AWS构建无服务器MCP服务器，实现AI智能体与数据湖的自动化集成。系统通过JSON元数据文件配置，无需重复开发SQL接口，支持多租户环境下的权限集中管控和弹性扩展。架构包含认证层、MCP服务器层、工具层和数据更新层，利用Amazon Bedrock和Athena服务，确保15-20秒内完成从自然语言查询到结构化数据返回的全流程。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/serverless-mcp-server-for-ai-agent-data-lake-access-on-amazon-ecs-fargate/","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T17:13:13.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a7c3302c0985fb1018d6e4d102c9e3a96e020635d636cac8ae02864664d03b7.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/4237b71601b7cec2b06ef2319001b3daa6952abcc9bca3ab8eef52724d47317d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a7c3302c0985fb1018d6e4d102c9e3a96e020635d636cac8ae02864664d03b7.webp 96w","itemId":"ocnntc4b03t3u6b4tup8wfu6p","title":"Google DeepMind发布Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash：原生